  Class: 18
  Name: Goby
  Description: Two seats, one hull, like a goby and the pistol shrimp it shares a burrow
    with. One player flies the Goby, the hull, on two thumbs and lays the path; the other
    rides that path side on as the Pistol, a sidescroller - diving down the hills,
    launching into clusters and firing vortex rings. D-pad left or right swaps seats;
    the AI takes the empty one.
